{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["PES: Peace Eco Smiles","A collaborative effort between the Japanese automaker and Japanese anime company Studio 4&deg;C, PES: Peace Eco Smile is a new web promotional anime series that centers around PES, a traveller from space, and NaSuBi, a mysterious life-form who is enamored by the charm of Earth. The car of choice for these strangers in a new world? The Prius, particularly the Prius Liftback and Prius C hatchback. These two hybrids seem to be as much a part of this series as the two main characters are. A Lexus LFA (likely the ride of the antagonist) and the Toyota Camry hybrid also have a role to play.\n\n\nEach anime short in the campaign will be three to four minutes long and will be posted on Toyota's specially-dedicated website.\n\n\n(Source: Auto Tribute)"],"ja":["PES: Peace Eco Smile",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-13427","ids":{"shikimori":13427,"mal":13427,"anilist":13427,"kodik":"serial-22402"},"kodikIds":["serial-20809","serial-22402"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-20809":"2020-01-07T16:23:19Z","serial-22402":"2020-02-04T21:19:54Z"},"title":"Улыбка Эко Гармонии","originalTitle":"PES: Peace Eco Smile","alt":"PES Peace Eco Smile PES: Peace Eco Smiles PES: Peace Eco Smile","description":"Совместная работа автомобильной компании Toyota и японской аниме-студии Studio 4°C .","year":2012,"type":"ONA","genres":["Фантастика","Повседневность","гонки","космос"],"rating":5.54,"popularity":1243,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/13427/3f422b691dc151e95014ec5e7d0d8f62.jpeg","width":318,"height":450},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/fcd8a8b655ab8e3a4871bafbf515217a5527b2ea.jpg","width":1280,"height":720}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources"